          "anchor": "3-continue-with-sft-and-verifiable-grpo",
          "quote": "GRPO uses an immutable reference made from this run's selected SFT model. For an OCR completion, reward is 0.8 × max(0, 1 − CER) + 0.2 × exact_match. Empty or truncated completions receive zero. Gold and predictions use NFC normalization and outer trimming; case, numbers, punctuation, and internal spaces remain meaningful. General QA replay keeps its existing task-specific verifier and original reward labels.",
